{
    "info":  {
                 "name":  "Article API",
                 "description":  "# Article API\n\nBase URL: `{{baseUrl}}`\n\n## Authentication\n\nAll APIs except `/api/auth/**` require header:\n\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer {{token}}\n```\n\nRun **Login** or **Register** first to auto-save `token`.\n\n## Comment Lock (`lockComment`)\n\nEach article has `lockComment` (boolean, default `false`):\n\n- `false`: others can comment\n- `true`: only article owner can add new comments\n\n## Pagination\n\n`GET /api/articles` supports query params:\n\n- `page` (default 0)\n- `size` (default 20)\n- `sort` (example: `createdAt,desc`)\n- optional `tag`\n\n## HTTP Status Codes\n\n| Status | Use case |\n|------|----------|\n| 200 | GET/PUT success |\n| 201 | Resource created |\n| 204 | Delete success |\n| 400 | Validation or bad request |\n| 401 | Unauthorized |\n| 403 | Forbidden |\n| 404 | Resource not found |\n| 409 | Conflict |\n| 500 | Internal server error |\n\n## Error Response\n\n```json\n{\n  \"code\": 40301,\n  \"message\": \"Not article owner\"\n}\n```\n\nValidation error includes `errors`:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"code\": 40001,\n  \"message\": \"Validation failed\",\n  \"errors\": { \"title\": \"Title is required\" }\n}\n```\n\nLocked comment error:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"code\": 40002,\n  \"message\": \"Article comments are locked\"\n}\n```",
                 "schema":  "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
             },
    "variable":  [
                     {
                         "key":  "baseUrl",
                         "value":  "http://localhost:8080"
                     },
                     {
                         "key":  "token",
                         "value":  ""
                     },
                     {
                         "key":  "articleId",
                         "value":  "1"
                     }
                 ],
    "item":  [
                 {
                     "name":  "Auth",
                     "description":  "Dang ky va dang nhap. Tra ve JWT token.",
                     "item":  [
                                  {
                                      "name":  "Register",
                                      "request":  {
                                                      "method":  "POST",
                                                      "header":  [
                                                                     {
                                                                         "key":  "Content-Type",
                                                                         "value":  "application/json"
                                                                     }
                                                                 ],
                                                      "body":  {
                                                                   "mode":  "raw",
                                                                   "raw":  "{\n  \"email\": \"test@example.com\",\n  \"username\": \"testuser\",\n  \"password\": \"123456\"\n}"
                                                               },
                                                      "url":  "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register",
                                                      "description":  "**POST** `/api/auth/register`\n\n**Auth:** Khong can\n\n**Response 201:**\n```json\n{\n  \"token\": \"eyJ...\",\n  \"email\": \"test@example.com\",\n  \"username\": \"testuser\"\n}\n```\n\n**Errors:** 400 validation, 409 trung email/username"
                                                  },
                                      "event":  [
                                                    {
                                                        "listen":  "test",
                                                        "script":  {
                                                                       "exec":  [
                                                                                    "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                                                                                    "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                                                                                    "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\u0027token\u0027, json.token);",
                                                                                    "}"
                                                                                ],
                                                                       "type":  "text/javascript"
                                                                   }
                                                    }
                                                ]
                                  },
                                  {
                                      "name":  "Login",
                                      "request":  {
                                                      "method":  "POST",
                                                      "header":  [
                                                                     {
                                                                         "key":  "Content-Type",
                                                                         "value":  "application/json"
                                                                     }
                                                                 ],
                                                      "body":  {
                                                                   "mode":  "raw",
                                                                   "raw":  "{\n  \"email\": \"test@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"123456\"\n}"
                                                               },
                                                      "url":  "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
                                                      "description":  "**POST** `/api/auth/login`\n\n**Auth:** Khong can\n\n**Body:** email, password\n\n**Response 200:** token, email, username\n\n**Errors:** 401 sai email/password"
                                                  },
                                      "event":  [
                                                    {
                                                        "listen":  "test",
                                                        "script":  {
                                                                       "exec":  [
                                                                                    "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                                                                                    "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                                                                                    "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\u0027token\u0027, json.token);",
                                                                                    "}"
                                                                                ],
                                                                       "type":  "text/javascript"
                                                                   }
                                                    }
                                                ]
                                  }
                              ]
                 },
                 {
                     "name":  "User",
                     "description":  "Quan ly thong tin user dang nhap.",
                     "item":  [
                                  {
                                      "name":  "Get Current User",
                                      "request":  {
                                                      "method":  "GET",
                                                      "header":  [
                                                                     {
                                                                         "key":  "Authorization",
                                                                         "value":  "Bearer {{token}}"
                                                                     }
                                                                 ],
                                                      "url":  "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/me",
                                                      "description":  "**GET** `/api/users/me`\n\n**Auth:** Bearer token\n\n**Response 200:**\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"email\": \"test@example.com\",\n  \"username\": \"testuser\"\n}\n```\n\n**Errors:** 401"
                                                  }
                                  },
                                  {
                                      "name":  "Update Profile",
                                      "request":  {
                                                      "method":  "PUT",
                                                      "header":  [
                                                                     {
                                                                         "key":  "Content-Type",
                                                                         "value":  "application/json"
                                                                     },
                                                                     {
                                                                         "key":  "Authorization",
                                                                         "value":  "Bearer {{token}}"
                                                                     }
                                                                 ],
                                                      "body":  {
                                                                   "mode":  "raw",
                                                                   "raw":  "{\n  \"username\": \"newusername\"\n}"
                                                               },
                                                      "url":  "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/me",
                                                      "description":  "**PUT** `/api/users/me`\n\n**Auth:** Bearer token\n\n**Body:** username (chi duoc sua username)\n\n**Response 200:** UserResponse\n\n**Errors:** 400, 401, 409 trung username"
                                                  }
                                  }
                              ]
                 },
                 {
                     "name":  "Articles",
                     "description":  "Quan ly bai viet. Home chi hien title + description; chi tiet co full content.\n\nField `lockComment` (boolean): khoa binh luan cho nguoi khac. Mac dinh `false`.",
                     "item":  [
                                  {
                                      "name":  "List Articles",
                                      "request":  {
                                                      "method":  "GET",
                                                      "header":  [
                                                                     {
                                                                         "key":  "Authorization",
                                                                         "value":  "Bearer {{token}}"
                                                                     }
                                                                 ],
                                                      "url":  "{{baseUrl}}/api/articles",
                                                      "description":  "**GET** `/api/articles`\n\n**Auth:** Bearer token\n\n**Query params (optional):** `tag`, `page`, `size`, `sort`\n\n**Response 200:** Spring Page of article summaries\n\n```json\n{\n  \"content\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": 1,\n      \"title\": \"Bai viet 1\",\n      \"description\": \"Mo ta ngan\",\n      \"tag\": \"java\",\n      \"lockComment\": false,\n      \"authorUsername\": \"testuser\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"page\": {\n    \"size\": 20,\n    \"number\": 0,\n    \"totalElements\": 1,\n    \"totalPages\": 1\n  }\n}\n```"
                                                  }
                                  },
                                  {
                                      "name":  "Get Article Detail",
                                      "request":  {
                                                      "method":  "GET",
                                                      "header":  [
                                                                     {
                                                                         "key":  "Authorization",
                                                                         "value":  "Bearer {{token}}"
                                                                     }
                                                                 ],
                                                      "url":  "{{baseUrl}}/api/articles/{{articleId}}",
                                                      "description":  "**GET** `/api/articles/{id}`\n\n**Auth:** Bearer token\n\n**Response 200:**\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"title\": \"Bai viet mau\",\n  \"description\": \"Mo ta ngan\",\n  \"content\": \"Noi dung day du...\",\n  \"tag\": \"springboot\",\n  \"lockComment\": false,\n  \"authorUsername\": \"testuser\",\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-05-22T10:00:00\",\n  \"updatedAt\": \"2026-05-22T10:00:00\"\n}\n```\n\n**Errors:** 404"
                                                  }
                                  },
                                  {
                                      "name":  "Create Article",
                                      "request":  {
                                                      "method":  "POST",
                                                      "header":  [
                                                                     {
                                                                         "key":  "Content-Type",
                                                                         "value":  "application/json"
                                                                     },
                                                                     {
                                                                         "key":  "Authorization",
                                                                         "value":  "Bearer {{token}}"
                                                                     }
                                                                 ],
                                                      "body":  {
                                                                   "mode":  "raw",
                                                                   "raw":  "{\n  \"title\": \"Bai viet mau\",\n  \"description\": \"Mo ta ngan ve bai viet\",\n  \"content\": \"Noi dung day du cua bai viet...\",\n  \"tag\": \"springboot\",\n  \"lockComment\": false\n}"
                                                               },
                                                      "url":  "{{baseUrl}}/api/articles",
                                                      "description":  "**POST** `/api/articles`\n\n**Auth:** Bearer token\n\n**Body:**\n| Field | Type | Required | Mo ta |\n|-------|------|----------|-------|\n| title | string | yes | Tieu de |\n| description | string | yes | Mo ta ngan |\n| content | string | yes | Noi dung |\n| tag | string | yes | Tag |\n| lockComment | boolean | no | Khoa binh luan (mac dinh `false`) |\n\n**Response 201:** ArticleResponse (co `lockComment`)\n\n**Errors:** 400 validation, 401"
                                                  },
                                      "event":  [
                                                    {
                                                        "listen":  "test",
                                                        "script":  {
                                                                       "exec":  [
                                                                                    "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                                                                                    "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                                                                                    "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\u0027articleId\u0027, json.id);",
                                                                                    "}"
                                                                                ],
                                                                       "type":  "text/javascript"
                                                                   }
                                                    }
                                                ]
                                  },
                                  {
                                      "name":  "Update Article",
                                      "request":  {
                                                      "method":  "PUT",
                                                      "header":  [
                                                                     {
                                                                         "key":  "Content-Type",
                                                                         "value":  "application/json"
                                                                     },
                                                                     {
                                                                         "key":  "Authorization",
                                                                         "value":  "Bearer {{token}}"
                                                                     }
                                                                 ],
                                                      "body":  {
                                                                   "mode":  "raw",
                                                                   "raw":  "{\n  \"title\": \"Bai viet da sua\",\n  \"description\": \"Mo ta moi\",\n  \"content\": \"Noi dung moi...\",\n  \"tag\": \"java\",\n  \"lockComment\": true\n}"
                                                               },
                                                      "url":  "{{baseUrl}}/api/articles/{{articleId}}",
                                                      "description":  "**PUT** `/api/articles/{id}`\n\n**Auth:** Bearer token\n\n**Quyen:** Chi chu bai viet\n\n**Body:** giong Create Article, bao gom `lockComment` de bat/tat khoa binh luan.\n\nVi du body co `\"lockComment\": true` de khoa comment cua nguoi khac.\n\n**Response 200:** ArticleResponse\n\n**Errors:** 400, 401, 403, 404"
                                                  }
                                  },
                                  {
                                      "name":  "Delete Article",
                                      "request":  {
                                                      "method":  "DELETE",
                                                      "header":  [
                                                                     {
                                                                         "key":  "Authorization",
                                                                         "value":  "Bearer {{token}}"
                                                                     }
                                                                 ],
                                                      "url":  "{{baseUrl}}/api/articles/{{articleId}}",
                                                      "description":  "**DELETE** `/api/articles/{id}`\n\n**Auth:** Bearer token\n\n**Quyen:** Chi chu bai viet\n\n**Response 204:** No Content\n\n**Errors:** 401, 403, 404"
                                                  }
                                  }
                              ]
                 },
                 {
                     "name":  "Comments",
                     "description":  "Binh luan bai viet.\n\n- Moi user da dang nhap deu co the comment neu bai **chua khoa** (`lockComment: false`).\n- Neu bai da khoa (`lockComment: true`): chi **chu bai** duoc comment; nguoi khac nhan **400**.\n- Van xem duoc comment cu (GET) khi bai da khoa.",
                     "item":  [
                                  {
                                      "name":  "List Comments",
                                      "request":  {
                                                      "method":  "GET",
                                                      "header":  [
                                                                     {
                                                                         "key":  "Authorization",
                                                                         "value":  "Bearer {{token}}"
                                                                     }
                                                                 ],
                                                      "url":  "{{baseUrl}}/api/articles/{{articleId}}/comments",
                                                      "description":  "**GET** `/api/articles/{id}/comments`\n\n**Auth:** Bearer token\n\n**Response 200:**\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"id\": 1,\n    \"content\": \"Binh luan hay!\",\n    \"authorUsername\": \"testuser\",\n    \"createdAt\": \"2026-05-22T10:00:00\"\n  }\n]\n```\n\n**Errors:** 404 bai viet khong ton tai"
                                                  }
                                  },
                                  {
                                      "name":  "Add Comment",
                                      "request":  {
                                                      "method":  "POST",
                                                      "header":  [
                                                                     {
                                                                         "key":  "Content-Type",
                                                                         "value":  "application/json"
                                                                     },
                                                                     {
                                                                         "key":  "Authorization",
                                                                         "value":  "Bearer {{token}}"
                                                                     }
                                                                 ],
                                                      "body":  {
                                                                   "mode":  "raw",
                                                                   "raw":  "{\n  \"content\": \"Binh luan hay!\"\n}"
                                                               },
                                                      "url":  "{{baseUrl}}/api/articles/{{articleId}}/comments",
                                                      "description":  "**POST** `/api/articles/{id}/comments`\n\n**Auth:** Bearer token\n\n**Body:** content\n\n**Response 201:** CommentResponse\n\n**Errors:**\n- 400 validation (`code=40001`)\n- 400 locked comments (`code=40002`, message `Article comments are locked`)\n- 401\n- 404"
                                                  }
                                  }
                              ]
                 }
             ]
}
